{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/reguliersbreestraat.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Reguliersbreestraat (the city, district 2: the Munt): the narrow street of shops, snack bars and clubs from Rembrandtplein to the Munt, a tram line down its middle, lights strung across it; on its south side the art-deco picture palace, on its north an apotheek with its green cross. Modelled after openly licensed photographs; every business name is made up, the landmarks keep theirs. The power is still on; nobody is there. Outdoor (street.py, city.py and landmarks.py build it). Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
